<title>JAPAN: OSE says seeks to list Niko Niko Do.</title>
<headline>OSE says seeks to list Niko Niko Do.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said on Wednesday that it has applied to the Finance Ministry for the listing of food and clothing retailer Niko Niko Do Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Niko Niko Do is expected to be listed on the OSE's second section on February 25, 1997.</p>
<p>Niko Niko Do, which also rents out real estate properties, is currently listed on the Fukuoka Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
